        "method_card": {
          "file": "method_card.md",
          "truncated": false,
          "text": "---\nname: CAA-honesty\nversion: v4\nsummary: Contrastive activation addition for honesty\n---\n\n# CAA-honesty\n\nContrastive activation addition (CAA) on the residual stream, steering toward honest completions.\n\n## Method\n\nA steering vector per model is the mean difference between the activations of honest and dishonest completions on a contrastive prompt set, added at one middle layer at inference time.\n\n## Models\n\nThe same recipe on all three base models; the layer and the scale are tuned per model on the public dev split.\n"
        }
